{{DISPLAYTITLE:FediFeeds}}
<languages />
<translate>
<!--T:1-->
FediFeeds is a MediaWiki extension that lets people on the Fediverse follow one narrow feed of a wiki, such as the new posts of a blog kept in a category, instead of a single account that announces every edit.

<!--T:2-->
Each feed is its own account. A Mastodon user follows <code>category_4521@wiki.example.org</code> the way they follow a person, and sees a post whenever a page is created in that category.

<!--T:3-->
Nothing is implemented yet. The [[<tvar name="1">Special:MyLanguage/Accounts</tvar>|spec]] comes first, and any part of it may change.

<!--T:4-->
FediFeeds is licensed under the [<tvar name="1">https://github.com/femiwiki/FediFeeds/blob/main/LICENSE</tvar> AGPL-3.0-or-later].
</translate>

